{"2965380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Relaxing Simulator", "steam_appid": 2965380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're here to simply do nothing for a while – welcome home.</strong><br>Become a floating spirit and explore peaceful places, alone or together with friends.<br>Enjoy tranquil landscapes, adjust the weather and lighting to match your mood, and experience relaxing moments without stress or objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between first-person and third-person view, discover forests, ruins, houses, islands, and other cozy places.<br>Interact with small details, relax by the campfire, or simply drift through the world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous achievements for relaxing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global leaderboard for everyone wondering:<br><strong>&quot;Why am I playing this? No idea... but I'm leaving my PC running – all for the leaderboard.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse levels in a relaxing atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just play, breathe, and let go.</strong><br>Perfect for unwinding... or for gentle meme-worthy adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>This game is a relaxing digital retreat, not a story game, not a competition, and not stressful.<br>Ideal for anyone who simply needs a break or is looking for a cozy moment.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're here to simply do nothing for a while – welcome home.</strong><br>Become a floating spirit and explore peaceful places, alone or together with friends.<br>Enjoy tranquil landscapes, adjust the weather and lighti